{
 "id": "rule-e0e67dc08492",
 "title": "openCustomDialog 承载点外取消时，起于框内可消费控件的 TOUCH_OUTSIDE 不关闭",
 "product": "代码",
 "triggers": [
  {
   "read": "规格写「点外取消」，或源端 Dialog / AlertDialog 没调 setCanceledOnTouchOutside(false)，对话框里有按钮、列表、输入框或可滚动正文",
   "wrong": "openCustomDialog 只靠 autoCancel: true（或默认值）、不设 onWillDismiss；或 onWillDismiss 里对 DismissReason.TOUCH_OUTSIDE 无条件 action.dismiss()"
  }
 ],
 "scope": "目标用 openCustomDialog 承载源端没关点外取消、且框内有会消费触摸的控件的对话框时",
 "exceptions": [],
 "how": [
  {
   "text": "给框内会消费触摸的区域（正文、列表、输入框、按钮条）挂 .onTouch：event.type === TouchType.Down 时登记「按下起于可消费区」；Up 或 Cancel 后等本次事件处理完再清除（如延到下一轮任务）",
   "support": [
    "case-96bad1fc979bd25d24d3#recommendation:3",
    "case-96bad1fc979bd25d24d3#diagnosis"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "openCustomDialog 设 onWillDismiss: (action) => { if (action.reason === DismissReason.TOUCH_OUTSIDE && 已登记) { return; } action.dismiss(); }；PRESS_BACK 照常关闭",
   "support": [
    "case-96bad1fc979bd25d24d3#recommendation:3",
    "case-96bad1fc979bd25d24d3#diagnosis"
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "登记和判断做成共享守卫，所有 openCustomDialog 的打开处都在 onWillDismiss 里先问它",
   "support": [
    "case-96bad1fc979bd25d24d3#diagnosis"
   ]
  }
 ],
 "values": [
  {
   "value": "autoCancel?: boolean，@default true —— Allows users to click the mask layer to exit.",
   "meaning": "不设就是点遮罩即关，声明没写按下点在哪",
   "source": "鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/api/@ohos.promptAction.d.ts，BaseDialogOptions.autoCancel",
   "support": []
  },
  {
   "value": "onWillDismiss?: Callback<DismissDialogAction>；注册后点遮罩、侧滑、返回键不会立刻关闭，由回调按 reason 决定",
   "meaning": "拦截关闭的入口",
   "source": "鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/api/@ohos.promptAction.d.ts，BaseDialogOptions.onWillDismiss；js-apis-promptAction.md，BaseDialogOptions",
   "support": []
  },
  {
   "value": "DismissDialogAction { dismiss: Callback<void>; reason: DismissReason }",
   "meaning": "回调参数：调 dismiss() 才关闭",
   "source": "鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/api/@ohos.promptAction.d.ts，DismissDialogAction",
   "support": []
  },
  {
   "value": "DismissReason.PRESS_BACK = 0（返回键、侧滑、Esc）；TOUCH_OUTSIDE = 1（点遮罩）；CLOSE_BUTTON = 2；SLIDE_DOWN = 3",
   "meaning": "关闭原因",
   "source": "鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/common.d.ts，DismissReason",
   "support": []
  },
  {
   "value": "onTouch(event: (event: TouchEvent) => void): T；TouchType 有 Down、Up、Move、Cancel",
   "meaning": "登记按下起点用的触摸回调",
   "source": "鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/common.d.ts，CommonMethod.onTouch；ets/component/enums.d.ts，TouchType",
   "support": []
  },
  {
   "value": "ArkUI 按抬起点判定：从框内按钮按下拖到遮罩松手会关闭，安卓不关；加守卫后两端同一组拖动手势逐项一致",
   "meaning": "改前改后的现象",
   "source": "卡里修好并验证过",
   "support": [
    "case-96bad1fc979bd25d24d3#diagnosis"
   ]
  },
  {
   "value": "onWillDismiss?: Callback<DismissDialogAction>（CustomDialogControllerOptions）",
   "meaning": "同族接口：CustomDialogController 承载时同样在这里拦 TOUCH_OUTSIDE",
   "source": "鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/custom_dialog_controller.d.ts，CustomDialogControllerOptions.onWillDismiss",
   "support": []
  },
  {
   "value": "onWillDismiss?: Callback<DismissDialogAction>（AlertDialogParam）",
   "meaning": "同族接口：AlertDialog 承载时同样在这里拦",
   "source": "鸿蒙 SDK 的 ets/component/alert_dialog.d.ts，AlertDialogParam.onWillDismiss",
   "support": []
  }
 ],
 "lookups": [],
 "why": "系统按抬起点判点外，按住框内控件拖到遮罩松手对话框就关了，源端不会",
